Amad
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
DRAW 20 DEAL {COLUMN, API}
API 2 FACE_ALL
API 7 FACE_ALL
API 9 FACE_ALL
API 1 FACE_ALL
API 10 FACE_ALL
API 10 FACE_LAST
API 1 FACE_LAST
API 2 FACE_LAST

COLUMN 1 FACE_LAST
COLUMN 8 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 7 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 7 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 5 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 3 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 5 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 6 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE_STACK COLUMN API
DESTSRC Rank descending
MOVE_STACK API API
AND
    OR
        SRC Suit {DIAMONDS, SPADES, CLUBS}
        DESTSRC Rank ascending
    DEST Empty
$win
AND
    OR
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
        PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
